WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.880
To accept the unknown

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.759
and to accept it in architecture,

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.595
you really need lots of courage.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.265
So, the first thing to do,

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.852
you have to jump.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:25.275
I was very attracted to these houses 
which looked so deteriorated.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.693
Everybody put me down.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:29.279
But I found inside myself

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:31.740
a strength to build our home.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:34.200
The three generation house

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.243
I built with my wife

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.162
my kids and
my parents-in-law.

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:40.331
There's a lot at stake if you're building
a home with your family members.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:45.128
We endeavor to interfere as little
as possible with nature.

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:48.465
Building this place, it gave
us a sense of peace.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.425
It saved us in a big way.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.181
Perfection is actually

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:59.100
around you, you only
just have to look

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:02.270
and appreciate it.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:09.152
This place was our dad's way
of keeping us connected.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:13.072
You can't construct
anything good

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:15.033
if it is not with love.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.420
I have a wonderful sense of

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.671
this is where I belong.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:32.008
This is something that just developed

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:34.260
with us working together as a family.

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.471
It's just become,

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.264
it's become us.

